      "id": 2609,
      "category": "team",
      "content": "@uranium238 discovered a vulnerability with a 3rd party email integration provider which would allow messages in Slack email integrations to be leaked. We worked with the 3rd party to get this issue resolved, and performed a thorough investigation to confirm that this had never been exploited. Thanks @uranium238 for an interesting finding!",
